  "conceptual_conclusion": "Whole-codebase reversible minification is neither necessary nor sufficient for token savings. Exact CAS restoration and the new bounded mapped-edit adapter preserve different fidelity contracts. The immediate missing token-efficiency mechanism is consistent indexed disclosure that replaces enough model-visible source and repeated reads to outweigh its own overhead.",
  "executable_equivalence_established_here": false,
