    {
      "detail": "Complete admitted historical inventory can cover up to 20000 entries/128 MiB, while semantic worker views are limited to 64 admitted files/1 MiB and native exact-source worker is limited to 32 paths. Stored whole-repository coverage does not expose whole-repository model navigation.",
