      "detail": "apply_source_view_edit_candidate applies one modified text file through an existing fenced IsolatedWorktree and caller PatchScope, requiring a fresh clean candidate plus source/view/manifest/generation pins. It checks staged bytes and the entire admitted postimage and refreshes the working generation. Incremental dirty-overlay editing, creates/deletes/moves, binary/specially quoted paths, authenticated worker write submission, accepted proof/index publication and atomic external-writer exclusion remain outside this adapter.",
